docs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:29490:          "evidence_quote": "We evaluated zero-shot histopathology classification on four public H&E benchmarks: MHIST, BACH, NCT-CRC-HE-100K and PatchCamelyon. For each image, the model was given a dataset-specific closed set of candidate class names and instructed to return exactly one class label. No task-specific fine-tuning, parameter updates or in-context examples were used.",
